        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the reins of power in the fictional Eastern European country of Gradnar, where you are dictator Vyslan Gatskolka, the unshakable leader and defender of the downtrodden. The fate of the nation hangs on your decisions: will you strive for democracy or plunge the country into autocracy, choose peace with your neighbors or conquer them in bloody wars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruthless control or people’s freedoms—your choice, but keep your finger on the pulse: the country’s indicators (economy, loyalty, control, party, and army) must not drop to zero, or a coup will end your reign. Navigate foreign policy: forge alliances, provoke enemies, or wage war, where battles turn into tense card duels. Supply your army, strike strategically, and, upon victory, annex the conquered lands into your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power isn’t just politics. Will you be an honest ruler rejecting bribes, or succumb to temptation? Your personal account tempts you: spend on the people’s needs or pamper yourself and your family—lavish palaces, rare paintings, pedigreed horses, and countless other trappings of luxury. After a grueling day, unwind with Riban over a game of cards—but don’t lose your fortune! If funds run low, corrupt schemes, bribes, and kickbacks are always at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path: nonlinear dialogues unlock new scenarios, and your actions lead to one of many endings. Will you become a great commander, a generous benefactor, or a ruthless tyrant? Gradnar awaits your verdict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Gradnar’s destiny through complex moral choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage wars with a unique card-based mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect certificates of ownership for valuable items in your safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store expensive treasures in your personal cabinet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dystopian atmosphere with satire and dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple endings based on your decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your wishlist and stay tuned—Gradnar will soon open its doors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the reins of power in the fictional Eastern European country of Gradnar, where you are dictator Vyslan Gatskolka, the unshakable leader and defender of the downtrodden. The fate of the nation hangs on your decisions: will you strive for democracy or plunge the country into autocracy, choose peace with your neighbors or conquer them in bloody wars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruthless control or people’s freedoms—your choice, but keep your finger on the pulse: the country’s indicators (economy, loyalty, control, party, and army) must not drop to zero, or a coup will end your reign. Navigate foreign policy: forge alliances, provoke enemies, or wage war, where battles turn into tense card duels. Supply your army, strike strategically, and, upon victory, annex the conquered lands into your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power isn’t just politics. Will you be an honest ruler rejecting bribes, or succumb to temptation? Your personal account tempts you: spend on the people’s needs or pamper yourself and your family—lavish palaces, rare paintings, pedigreed horses, and countless other trappings of luxury. After a grueling day, unwind with Riban over a game of cards—but don’t lose your fortune! If funds run low, corrupt schemes, bribes, and kickbacks are always at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path: nonlinear dialogues unlock new scenarios, and your actions lead to one of many endings. Will you become a great commander, a generous benefactor, or a ruthless tyrant? Gradnar awaits your verdict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Gradnar’s destiny through complex moral choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage wars with a unique card-based mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect certificates of ownership for valuable items in your safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store expensive treasures in your personal cabinet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dystopian atmosphere with satire and dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple endings based on your decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your wishlist and stay tuned—Gradnar will soon open its doors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "short_description": "Become the Dictator of Gradnar! Rule the nation, choose between democracy and tyranny, wage wars with a unique card-based mechanic, and expand your empire. A political dystopia packed with satire and humor!",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil",
